1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,735
In 1950, a baby born in Spain could expect to live about 62 years. In Norway,

2
00:00:07,735 --> 00:00:08,675
almost 72.

3
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:10,700
Watch Spain.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,550
1982. Spain passes Norway.

5
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:19,875
And it keeps on climbing.

6
00:00:22,275 --> 00:00:25,700
The pandemic briefly puts Norway back in front.

7
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:34,025
But by 2023, Spain is ahead again: 83.7 years, against Norway's 83.3.

8
00:00:34,425 --> 00:00:37,656
That's almost 22 extra years in one lifetime.

9
00:00:37,656 --> 00:00:40,600
The whole of Europe is in our full video.
